  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SECORES Joint Platform on Social-Ecological Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The different types of Belgian cooperation actors (NGOs, IAs including universities and colleges, bilateral actors, multilateral actors with headquarters in Belgium; 4th pillars; national or regional authorities; national and international platforms and structures; the 3 other thematic JSFs and the 26 country JSFs and their members. Existing platforms (biodiversity coalition, climate coalition, ...) will also be included in the exchanges and advocacy work.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The integration of social-ecological resilience in Belgian cooperation is increased.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This outcome covers the joint action of the SECORES network formed by the 6 members of the thematic JSF on social-ecological resilience (network SECORES). It aims to increase the space for exchange and learning and the complementarity, synergy and collaboration in building social-ecological resilience in the partner countries as well as strengthening national and international advocacy in this field.</narrative>
  </description>
